# Base URL of the FastAPI backend.
#
# Local dev: leave unset (delete this file's value, or don't create .env
# at all) — App.jsx falls back to http://127.0.0.1:8000.
#
# Separate-domain deploy (e.g. frontend on Vercel, backend on Render):
# VITE_API_URL=https://aerolens-api.onrender.com
#
# Same-domain deploy (frontend + backend both on Vercel, via vercel.json's
# /api/* rewrite): set explicitly to an empty string so the app calls
# relative /api/* paths instead of an absolute URL. An empty string is
# intentionally different from leaving the variable unset.
# VITE_API_URL=
#
# Left commented out on purpose: copying this file straight to .env should
# not silently switch local dev into relative-path mode.
